# TypeScript strictness

| Rule | Policy |
|------|--------|
| `@ts-nocheck` | Forbidden |
| `@ts-ignore` | Forbidden |
| `@ts-expect-error` | Allowed on one line with description ≥ 10 characters |

Vendored or generated code must still type-check (no file-level nocheck).
